  "description": "Build your future by studying in the UK, with a pathway course at Kaplan International College (KIC) London. Situated in the world’s top academic city (QS Best Student Cities 2019), the College will prepare you for a university degree, and for a successful career. If you’ve finished high school but don’t meet the entry requirements for university, a Foundation Certificate can help you gain entry to an undergraduate degree. For progression to the 1st year of a bachelor’s degree at City, University of London. City has all the benefits students expect of a London university - strong links with business for career opportunities and unbeatable opportunities for sport, culture and entertainment, and is ranked 3rd&nbsp;in London for student satisfaction (Complete University Guide 2020). Timestamps Updated",
